From e4365aa8813ad0465400614df1c0378b9fa5d74b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:03:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Media downloads: resumable fetch pipeline, lazy media,
 storage usage (Phases 1-4)

Phase 1: core:mediadownload module - media_downloads table (v8, Migration7To8),
chunked resumable OkHttp transfer with Range/If-Range, host allowlist,
MediaDownloadRepository (request/pause/resume/cancel/recovery/usage queries).

Phase 2: lazy thumbnails via Coil size(), two-stage photo viewer,
DownloadProgressRing, remoteMediaPolicy setting (Always/Wi-Fi/Ask/Never).

Phase 3: tap-to-play videos with visible fetch progress, auto-pause on exit,
byte-offset resume through the repository pipeline.

Phase 4: Settings > Storage Usage screen backed by real byte totals.

CI: .github/workflows/build.yml runs ./gradlew assembleDebug on every push
and uploads the debug APK as artifact.
