+/**
+ * The designsystem-side contract for the two-stage remote-media interaction.
+ *
+ * Implemented in the app module on top of the download manager; screens and tiles reach it
+ * through [LocalRemoteTileController], so the same tap behaviour runs in chat bubbles, media
+ * grids and viewer pages without any of them importing the download module.
+ */
